    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Welcome to Coffee Simulator!&quot; Manage your caf\u00e9, grow it, and strive to become a global brand.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392160/extras/39f067f211233f62567e452c09147a60.webp?t=1743501305\" width=274 height=25 /></span><strong> </strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your menu and set your prices. Focus on customer satisfaction to expand your caf\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392160/extras/cb1e199543b89a95b19e334e1e4bec3e.poster.avif?t=1743501305\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392160/extras/cb1e199543b89a95b19e334e1e4bec3e.webm?t=1743501305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392160/extras/cb1e199543b89a95b19e334e1e4bec3e.mp4?t=1743501305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392160/extras/1483226f3bed11f638103f1af5974a3f.webp?t=1743501305\" width=383 height=24 /></span><strong></strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customize the interior design of your caf\u00e9. Choose furniture and decor to create a unique atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392160/extras/bc4e95ab0476361a7a67fe0d943cce15.poster.avif?t=1743501305\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta